    "committer": "GitHub <noreply@github.com>",
    "message": "Merge pull request #25 from NICHD-BSPC/v0.99.9\n\nV0.99.9\n\n- add scatter plot features\n  - table can be filtered by significance\n  - genes can be selected in the plot and shown in the table\n  - genes can be selected in the table and added to 'Gene scratchpad'\n- allow users to add pattern analysis results to carnation object using the 'Load data' -> 'New' UI\n- add support for edgeR & limma\n- show currently loaded dataset on 'Load data' page\n- update contributors",
    "time": 1773804128
  },
